  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14123192/assets/e679efaa2612d45bbfe8b918de7148853b64eaf530af34a525ef1735e0946b09.png)\n\nConsider the circle $S$ and vector field $F$ shown above. Let $C$ be any path where $S$ is traversed once in the counterclockwise direction. \n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n- The flux of $F$ across $C$ is positive\n- The flux of $F$ across $C$ is zero\n- The flux of $F$ across $-C$ is positive",
